e  paramount war he said about Luffy and I  quote it's not his powers or techniques  he possesses some quality that makes  people want to help him and in these  waters that is the most formidable power  of all and quote I think shanks is so  strong because he possesses this quality  too  we mentioned his insane hockey and he's  clearly an exceptional fighter but my  theory is that it is shanks his  influence and his powerful and loyal  crew that make him one of the most  powerful and dangerous pirates in the  world the angka are not the strongest  pirates per se they're the strongest  pirate captains  they all have crews that are extremely  powerful I'd argue that one-on-one me  Hawk could beat shanks but me Hawk is a  lone wolf  he has no crew if we factor in shanks  his whole powerful crew then mihawk  probably wouldn't stand a chance  I believe that Blackbeard could also  pose a threat to shanks one-on-one but  since shanks his crew was there along  with the remaining white beer pirates  and the Marines I don't think even the  insanely confident Blackbeard felt like  he could ensure a victory so he left in  order to wait for a more favorable  chance anyways that is my view on how  strong I think shanks is after looking  at all the evidence there's totally  space for debate here hu to order left  that space on purpose I'm sure to keep  us wondering and engaged however I think  that all those shanks is super strong he  is not the strongest character in the  series and there are multiple characters  that could be on his level or stronger  one-on-one like Blackbeard a me hawk  shanks truly shines when you combine his  power with his powerful crew and his  ability to influence others he could  successfully intercept Kaido get a hyped  up Blackbeard to leave the battlefield  get Marco the Phoenix to obey Him get  sangoku to agree to his terms and get  the five elders to meet him as mihawk  suggests that it's this quality that is  the most formidable power of all and it  seems like shanks arguably possesses the  most of it so far his ability to  influence people and get them to help  him along with his impressive individual  strength is what truly makes him one of  the most dangerous and powerful  characters in the world of one piece and  that is it for today's video thank you  so much for watching if you want to see  more videos like this make sure to smash  that like button to let me know and I'll  get to the next one as soon as we hit  4,000 likes on this video a special  thank you goes to our patrons over on  patreon who help us survive YouTube  issues and who helped make videos like  this one possible first and foremost I  want to think are the one tier patrons  the ones who stand atop all clans Steven  and Greta a Lola autumn the world  stealers the school bus  Theisen Kirino acquired respect and  pattaya and I can't forget our pro hero  to your patrons the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  Odin Anatole kazansky alpha do angel  Cruz team Sparky 65 Rohan Kapoor cricket  XP $30 beat Ted no Ted Salter Joel  Stanton very Gucci Jessica Calif on Ally  Shaktar emperor otaku and JCCC waka  thank you all so much if you enjoy our  work you can support more by going over  to patreon compro and becoming a patron  today for as little as $1 if you do so  you'll get your name featured in future  videos alongside these amazing people  right here and you'll even get access to  our private patron only discord where we  talk about anime life and of course dank  memes so check out patreon.com/lenguin  if you prefer whichever way you choose  to support us you can get the same great  benefits thanks again and until next  time see you space cowboys  [Music]
 

